---
description: Persist only approved current-state evidence using feature/project/platform slots
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENTS.md` §5 and `docs/evidence/README.md` for all evidence collection.
Persist only approved current-state artifacts in
`docs/evidence/<feature>/<project>/<platform>/`, using stable lowercase kebab-case
names. Replace the impacted slot and delete superseded files; preserve unrelated
slots. Record source revision, capture method, checks and approval provenance.
Before/after comparisons, raw recordings, failed runs and drafts stay in ignored
`work/evidence/` or system temp. Do not persist dated, branch-named or versioned
history folders, and do not restore historical media into the current tree.
Use Git history and commit-SHA links for prior evidence.
